<title>LITHUANIA: Lithuania Jan-Feb trade deficit 915.8 mln litas.</title>
<headline>Lithuania Jan-Feb trade deficit 915.8 mln litas.</headline>
<dateline>VILNIUS 1997-05-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Lithuania's trade deficit in the first two months of the year was 915.8 million litas, the</p>
<p>statistics department said on Tuesday.</p>
<p> LITHUANIA TRADE BALANCE    Jan-Feb '97   Jan-Feb '96</p>
<p> Exports			  2.159	   1.905</p>
<p> Imports			  3.075	   2.329</p>
<p> Balance			 -915.8	  -424</p>
<p>-- Riga newsroom, +371 721 5240</p>
</text>
